Koleksi ensiklopedia (53-api-ensiklopedia.md).
Publik: GET /api/v1/encyclopedia/articles, categories, tags.
Usulan: POST /api/v1/encyclopedia/contributions (login),
PATCH /api/v1/encyclopedia/contributions/:id (edit pending / needs_revision),
GET /api/v1/encyclopedia/me/contributions.
Admin: /api/v1/admin/encyclopedia/...
}
